            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Starred has its own view

Press **⌘S** in the panel to see only your starred items, and **⌘S** again
to get back. Your recents now always show the newest thing first. Starring no
longer pushes it down the list.

To star something, press **⇧⌘S**, or right-click it and choose **Star**. This
works on text, screenshots, recordings and GIFs, and starred pictures get a
small star badge. In the starred view, items stay in the order you starred
them, so each one keeps its number.

As before, starred items survive Clear All and the automatic cleanup, and
⌘⌫ won't delete one until you unstar it.
]]></description>
